  "why_this_one": "The silver-blue javelin guard statue, 2.7 m tall, with a blue-and-gold kite shield and a plume: about fifty to an arena down its east side, turned -90 degrees to face the knights across the yard. Its one 4-key idle plays at the object's speed. docs/devil-square-port.md, Part B section 1.2.",
